kernora-apps (1.1.62) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Task Manager (kernora-taskmanager), Ctrl+Shift+Esc or Ctrl+Esc:
    - Apps: running apps grouped by their cgroup (ksysguard
      ApplicationDataModel) with CPU and memory, End task;
    - Background processes: everything else of yours, or of all users,
      searchable, End process;
    - Performance: live CPU, memory, graphics, disk and network charts
      from ksystemstats (KQuickCharts). Graphics cards that don't report
      their load say so instead of showing 0 %.
    Click a column's header to sort by it. Ending asks first; when
    something is still running five seconds later a "Force quit" button
    sends SIGKILL.
  * What's new: Task Manager.
  * Require kernora-desktop 1.4.53 (its icon), ksystemstats, the
    ksysguard, kitemmodels and quickcharts QML modules and
    libksysguard-bin, whose KAuth helper ends other users' processes
    after asking for the password.

