  * Settings has its own pages for the advanced sound, format, keyboard,
    touchpad and mouse, power and screen settings, so those rows no longer
    open KDE's modules in a separate window.
  * The language row shows the language again when the session names it
    with a region (ru_RU instead of ru).
  * Mouse and touchpad switches show their new state right away.

